L2.G3_UIU_2 → U L2.G4           # ర ra: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G4
L2.G4 → I L2.G4_III_1           # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G4_III_1 → I L2.G4_III_2     # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G4_III_2 → I L2.G5           # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G5
L2.G5 → U L2.G5_UUU_1           # మ ma: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G5_UUU_1 → U L2.G5_UUU_2     # మ ma: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G5_UUU_2 → U L2.G6           # మ ma: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G6
L2.G6 → I L2.G6_IUU_1           # య ya: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G6_IUU_1 → U L2.G6_IUU_2     # య ya: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G6_IUU_2 → U L2.G7           # య ya: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G7
L2.G7 → I L2.G7_IUNL_1          # వ va: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G7_IUNL_1 → U L2.G7_IUNL_2   # వ va: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G7_IUNL_2 → ⏎ L3.G1          # వ va: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G1
