L3.G5_UUU_2 → U L3.G6           # మ ma: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G6
L3.G6 → I L3.G6_IUU_1           # య ya: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G6_IUU_1 → U L3.G6_IUU_2     # య ya: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
